# Docs Synchronization

When changing modules, routes, DB models, API, or Docker — update `docs/DESIGN_DOC.md`:

- API Endpoints table
- Data definition / ER diagram
- Rollout Plan phase
- System diagram if architecture changed

Run `make ai-check-docs` before completing the task.

The design doc is the contract for all AI agents and human reviewers.
